# Frontend variables only. Never put Paystack secret keys, Google credentials,
# or email API secrets here.
#
# The browser now posts bookings to the same-origin /api/bookings route served
# by a Vercel serverless function. That function forwards the payload to the
# Google Apps Script web app using the server-side APPS_SCRIPT_URL variable
# (set in Vercel Project Settings, NOT here). No upstream URL belongs in this
# file and none is exposed to browser code.